  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Codex Token 與費用估算的證據界線",
      "description": "說明 Codex 原生診斷、canonical accounting 與公開 API 牌價估算之間的界線。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### Codex 新資料檢查\n\n原生 `codex_*` panels 保留 provider 診斷；token accounting 與費用 panels 只讀取同一批 Codex telemetry 產生的三個 canonical recording metrics。費用為 **公開 API 基礎牌價估算**，不是 Codex 訂閱、credits、Enterprise contract 或帳單。只有 exact model/rate 可估價，`codex-auto-review` 與 `unmapped` 會保留在未估價表。因聚合 telemetry 無法判斷單次輸入是否超過 272K，目前未套用長 context 加價。畫面只讀取 `accounting_schema=v1`，並排除 toolkit runtime fixture 命名空間。"}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "最後觀測累積計價 Token",
      "description": "所選時間範圍內最後一筆 Codex exporter counter 的不重複累積值；新 series 第一筆即可見。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": ""}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"})", "legendFormat": "Token"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "所選範圍預估費用（USD）",
      "description": "所選時間範圍內可依 exact rate card 估價的增量；以版本化公開 API 基礎牌價估算，不是帳單、訂閱或 credits，未估價用量不會被猜價。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 6, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": ""}, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "colorMode": "value"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(ai_agent_estimated_cost_usd_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "Estimated cost", "instant": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "估價覆蓋率",
      "description": "有 exact model/rate 對應的 accounting token 比例。",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": ""}, "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"} and on (ai_agent_provider, model_id, usage_class) ai_agent_token_price_usd_per_million) / sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"})", "legendFormat": "Coverage"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Cached input 比例",
      "description": "Cached input 占全部 input accounting classes 的比例。",
      "type": "gauge",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 18, "y": 4, "w": 6, "h": 6},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": ""}, "showThresholdLabels": false, "showThresholdMarkers": true},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",usage_class=\"input_cached\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}) / sum(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",usage_class=~\"input_.+\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"})", "legendFormat": "Cache ratio"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "原生 Token 類型（除錯用）",
      "description": "Codex 原生 histogram sum；input、cached_input、reasoning_output、total 等類型不可直接全部相加。",
      "type": "barchart",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 10, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{model=~\"$model\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (model, token_type)", "legendFormat": "{{model}} - {{token_type}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "所選時間範圍：按模型與分類統計預估費用",
      "description": "只顯示成功對應 rate card 的用量，legend 保留 rate-card 版本。",
      "type": "barchart",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 10, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(ai_agent_estimated_cost_usd_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (model_id, usage_class, rate_card_version)", "legendFormat": "{{model_id}} {{usage_class}} - {{rate_card_version}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "最後觀測未估價累積 Token",
      "description": "所選範圍內無 exact model/usage-class rate 的最後累積 token；不會被猜價或隱藏。",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 18, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "decimals": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (model_id, usage_class) (last_over_time(ai_agent_token_usage_total{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",model_id=~\"$model\",accounting_schema=\"v1\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range]) unless on (ai_agent_provider, model_id, usage_class) ai_agent_token_price_usd_per_million)", "legendFormat": "{{model_id}} {{usage_class}}", "format": "table", "instant": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "目前 Rate Card（USD / 1M tokens）",
      "description": "版本化公開 API 基礎牌價，pricing_scope=base_standard_context。",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 18, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm"},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "max by (model_id, usage_class, currency, rate_card_version, rate_card_source, pricing_scope) (ai_agent_token_price_usd_per_million{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",model_id=~\"$model\"})", "legendFormat": "{{model_id}} {{usage_class}}", "format": "table", "instant": true}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "回合耗時 P95（Turn duration）",
      "description": "Codex 原生端到端回合耗時。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 26, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(codex_turn_e2e_duration_ms_bucket{model=~\"$model\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "{{model}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "首個 Token 等待時間 P95（TTFT）",
      "description": "Codex 原生 Time to first token histogram。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 26, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(codex_turn_ttft_duration_ms_bucket{model=~\"$model\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "{{model}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "工具呼叫（Tool calls）",
      "description": "Codex 原生單調遞增工具呼叫 counter。",
      "type": "barchart",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 34, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_tool_call{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (tool, success)", "legendFormat": "{{tool}} 成功={{success}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "MCP 呼叫與錯誤（Calls and errors）",
      "description": "Codex 原生 MCP counters；分開顯示呼叫與錯誤。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 34, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_mcp_call{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (status)", "legendFormat": "呼叫 {{status}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_mcp_error{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (status)", "legendFormat": "錯誤 {{status}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Responses API 耗時 P95",
      "description": "Codex 回報的推論時間與 client-side 額外開銷。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(codex_responses_api_inference_time_duration_ms_bucket{model=~\"$model\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "推論 {{model}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(codex_responses_api_overhead_duration_ms_bucket{model=~\"$model\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, model))", "legendFormat": "額外開銷 {{model}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "內容壓縮、Skill 注入與 Thread",
      "description": "Codex 原生 lifecycle counters。",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 42, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_task_compact{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (type, manual)", "legendFormat": "壓縮 {{type}} 人工={{manual}}"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_skill_injected{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (source)", "legendFormat": "Skill {{source}}"},
        {"refId": "C", "expr": "sum(increase(codex_thread_started{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}[$__range])) by (source)", "legendFormat": "Thread {{source}}"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": ["ai-collaboration", "codex", "native", "token", "estimated-cost", "opentelemetry"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
        "query": {"query": "label_values(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}, model)", "refId": "model-variable"},
        "definition": "label_values(codex_turn_token_usage_sum{service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}, model)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {"selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"]}
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Codex 原生 Telemetry（Codex Native Telemetry）",
  "uid": "ai-codex-usage",
  "version": 5,
  "description": "經隱私過濾的 Codex 原生 telemetry，另以三個明確允許的 ai_agent recording metrics 提供不重複 token accounting、版本化牌價與估算費用；不查詢 AI Context 或 Antigravity。"
}
